SkateAndreas is a mod for Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas and reTHAWed. It contains
only our own code: no game assets, no decompiled code and no extracted game files
(see AGENTS.md rule 1). Neither game is included, and the map the mod skates on is
built by the player from their own copy of GTA (tools/gta_to_thaw_map.py) for that
reason.

This repository builds against plugin-sdk (https://github.com/DK22Pac/plugin-sdk),
which is under the zlib licence and is not part of this repository.
